{
  "$comment": [
    "The LPS icon library (M15b). Curated against the corpus's own vocabulary:",
    "a functor census over legacy_lps1/examples gave finance and contracts,",
    "legal and governance, puzzles and games, places and motion, things and",
    "processes — and these are the icons that cover it.",
    "",
    "`concepts` is what the assistant matches on when it writes display/2 for a",
    "program it has just read, so the words there are the words a fluent or an",
    "action is likely to be called.",
    "",
    "Licences. openmoji: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://openmoji.org). game-icons:",
    "CC BY 3.0 (https://game-icons.net), attribution to the individual author",
    "recorded per icon by the set. Both are reproduced in the About dialog and",
    "in docs/lps_summary.md. Files are fetched by ui/fetch-icons.mjs and served",
    "from our own endpoint, so a deployment with no internet still animates."
  ],
